    "https://careers.lmunet.edu/postings/45914": {
      "title": "Assistant/Associate/Professor of Pathology, DCOM, OPFL",
      "description": "Lincoln Memorial University Applicant Portal | Assistant/Associate/Professor of Pathology, DCOM, OPFL Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA) Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA) LMU Annual Security Availability Know Your Rights Assistant/Associate/Professor of Pathology, DCOM, OPFL Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Assistant/Associate/Professor of Pathology, DCOM, OPFL Department DCOM BASIC SCIENCES Position Category Faculty Job Description The Assistant/Associate/Professor of Pathology ( DCOM at LMU -Orange Park shall have the primary responsibility of teaching general pathology, systemic pathology and histology in accordance with the LMU - DCOM approved curriculum and shall be held accountable for scholarly activity and service as they contribute to the attainment of the mission of the University, the School, and the Department Required Qualifications MD or DO, must be board certified in Anatomic Pathology and Clinical Pathology with an excellent scholarly record; or a Ph.D. in pathology with experience teaching histology and systemic pathology; able to be licensed in Florida within the first- year of hire date by the Florida Board of Osteopathic Medicine/Florida Board of Medicine; unrestricted Florida license. Preferred Qualifications Physical Demands Campus Orange Park Florida Job Duty Posting Detail Information Posting Number F01581P Job Open Date 09/02/2026 Job Close Date 12/31/2026 Open Until Filled No Special Instructions Summary About the Institution Lincoln Memorial University is a values-based learning community dedicated to providing educational experiences in the liberal arts and professional studies. The main campus is located in Harrogate, Tennessee. For more information about employment opportunities, contact the Office of Hu