    "https://careers.lmunet.edu/postings/46313": {
      "title": "Adjunct, MPA",
      "description": "Lincoln Memorial University Applicant Portal | Adjunct, MPA Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA) Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA) LMU Annual Security Availability Know Your Rights Adjunct, MPA Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Adjunct, MPA Department Masters of Public Administrati Position Category Adjunct Job Description Teach online graduate classes to students enrolled in the LMU Master of Public Administration program for the Fall 2021 semester Required Qualifications Terminal degree (PhD) in Political Science, Public Administration, or a closely related field with at least 9 graduate hours in health care policy or administration coursework or equivalent experience. Preferred Qualifications Experience teaching online courses at the graduate level, especially using Blackboard. Experience with running healthcare organizations. Physical Demands Campus Harrogate Job Duty Job Duty promote the mission of Lincoln Memorial University to all faculty, staff, students and to the community at large; Job Duty promote effective working relationships among faculty, staff, and students Job Duty provide course and classroom conduct as outlined in the Faculty-Staff Policy Manual Job Duty conduct office/conference hours; Job Duty submit textbook requests; Job Duty participate in annual faculty evaluation; Job Duty and perform other duties as assigned within the scope of current position Job Duty Other duties may be assigned on an as need basis. Posting Detail Information Posting Number F01855P Job Open Date Job Close Date Open Until Filled No Special Instructions Summary About the Institution Lincoln Memorial University is a values-based learning community dedicated to providing educational experiences in the liberal arts and professional studies. Th